&lt;p&gt;We aim to build a comprehensive database of replication studies across all disciplines.
If you have conducted a replication study that we have not yet included, or just seen one,
please submit it using the form below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to check if a replication study is already included in the database,
the easiest way is to use the
&lt;a href="https://staging.forrt.org/annotator" target="_blank"&gt;References Annotator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;form class="gform" action="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeMCwdtP0TPgL55stniuyyTxnNwyC34mO4VUuLcQwYrLI89sQ/formResponse" method="post"
data-gform-confirmation="Your response has been recorded."&gt;
&lt;div class="gform-body"&gt;
&lt;p class="gform-description"&gt;Please use this form if you would like to submit a reproduction or replication study in a brief and semi-structured format.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;When can a study be considered to be a &lt;i&gt;reproduction&lt;/i&gt;?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The study is assigned to one original study that tested at least one same hypothesis.&lt;br&gt;The study uses the &lt;b&gt;same dataset&lt;/b&gt; as the original study.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;When can a study be considered to be a &lt;i&gt;replication&lt;/i&gt;?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The study is assigned to one original study that tested at least one same hypothesis.&lt;br&gt;The study tries to mirror the methods of the original study and justify deviations&lt;br&gt;Replicated and reported tests use &lt;b&gt;data that differ&lt;/b&gt; from the data used in the original study.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Is this form for references, studies, or findings?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this form, we ask you to enter references that include at least one replication or reproduction. You can indicate how many studies are included in the reference. Specifically, we are looking for unique pairs of 'original study + replication study'.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Will I become a contributor to the FORRT Library of Reproduction and Replication Attempts (FLoRA) by using this form?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;You need to submit at least five new and correct entries via this form and write an email to lukas.roeseler@uni-muenster.de if you would like to be listed as a contributor to the FORRT Replication Database.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;How long does it take for my entry to be added to the FORRT Replication Database?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As of spring 2026, the database is undergoing major expansion. Time for addition may range from one week to multiple months. Please send us an email if you want to learn about the status of your submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="gform-text"&gt;This form is part of the &lt;a href="https://forrt.org/replication-hub" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;FORRT Replication Hub&lt;/a&gt;. For more info send an e-mail to Lukas Röseler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;fieldset class="gform-question"&gt;
&lt;legend class="gform-title"&gt;I have read the instructions and confirm that this study is not already listed in FLoRA. For this, I have searched for it via the &lt;a href="https://forrt.org/flora-replication-atlas/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Replication Atlas&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;span class="gform-required"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/legend&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-option"&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.737171809" value="I confirm." required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;I confirm.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;/fieldset&gt;
&lt;fieldset class="gform-question"&gt;
&lt;legend class="gform-title"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Type of "Repetition" Study&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class="gform-required"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/legend&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-option"&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.595177222" value="Replication (different data)" required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Replication (different data)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-option"&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.595177222" value="Reproduction (same data)" required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Reproduction (same data)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-option"&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.595177222" value="Both" required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Both&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;/fieldset&gt;
&lt;fieldset class="gform-question"&gt;
&lt;legend class="gform-title"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Type of Replication Reference &lt;/b&gt;(must be a complete and citable study, i.e., no preregistration, no email exchange, no published data without report; if there are multiple replication studies of the same target study in a paper, please try to code what the authors say about each individual study with one filled-out form per study) &lt;span class="gform-required"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/legend&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-option"&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.1677363533" value="Individual Study (i.e., one paper with one study)" required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Individual Study (i.e., one paper with one study)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-option"&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.1677363533" value="Multiple Studies (i.e., one paper with multiple studies)" required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Multiple Studies (i.e., one paper with multiple studies)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-option"&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.1677363533" value="Multilab Replication" required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Multilab Replication&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-option"&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.1677363533" value="Results only (i.e., there is no paper with a thorough description of the study)" required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Results only (i.e., there is no paper with a thorough description of the study)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;div class="gform-option gform-other"&gt;
&lt;label&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.1677363533" value="__other_option__" required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Other:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;input class="gform-input" type="text" name="entry.1677363533.other_option_response" aria-label="Other answer"&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/fieldset&gt;
&lt;fieldset class="gform-question"&gt;
&lt;legend class="gform-title"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meta Paper&lt;/b&gt;: For a replication reference that includes multiple studies: Are all &lt;b&gt;studies on the same topic&lt;/b&gt; or does it include &lt;b&gt;unrelated replications/reproductions&lt;/b&gt; (e.g., &lt;a href="https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aac4716" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Open Science Collaboration, 2015&lt;/a&gt; includes many unrelated studies). For example, &lt;a href="https://mgto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Chen-et-al-hindsight-bias-replications-extensions-print.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;a paper reporting replications of two different original papers&lt;/a&gt; would not be considered a meta paper. &lt;span class="gform-required"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/legend&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-option"&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.1334392718" value="Does not apply (single-study report)" required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Does not apply (single-study report)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-option"&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.1334392718" value="All studies are on the same topic" required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;All studies are on the same topic&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-option"&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" name="entry.1334392718" value="Studies are not all on the same topic" required&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Studies are not all on the same topic&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;/fieldset&gt;
&lt;div class="gform-question"&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-title" for="gform-YrLI89sQ-1001824025"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field &lt;/b&gt;(e.g., Psychology, Management Science, ...)&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;input class="gform-input" id="gform-YrLI89sQ-1001824025" type="text" name="entry.1001824025"&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="gform-question"&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-title" for="gform-YrLI89sQ-1957272128"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt; (e.g., "cascade effect (eye tracking) ", "red romance effect", "people are more sensitive to the dosage of harm-based transgressions than purity transgressions") &lt;span class="gform-required"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;input class="gform-input" id="gform-YrLI89sQ-1957272128" type="text" name="entry.1957272128" required&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="gform-question"&gt;
&lt;label class="gform-title" for="gform-YrLI89sQ-355822122"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reference - Original&lt;/b&gt; in APA format with DOI &lt;span class="gform-required"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;textarea class="gform-input" id="gform-YrLI89sQ-355822122" name="entry.355822122" rows="3" required&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;
